  "bio": "Emy Fernández Tattoo Studio in Canoas, Brazil, offers an intimate oasis for those seeking exquisite, custom floral ink. With an emphasis on artistic exclusivity, this private studio blooms with creativity and does not offer piercing services, ensuring a focus purely on the art of tattooing. Discover a serene environment where every design by @emyfernandestattoo and @jackferreiratattoo blossoms into a personal masterpiece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Canoas, Rio Grande Do Sul, Brazil"
